// interaction), the sheet in the app's light palette. The board carries the trip
// context: destination photo, title, slot pills while planning, build tiles, the
// version badge. Options (routes, hotels, days, destinations) are horizontal rails.
// While a trip is still being planned, every slot can change — travellers, dates,
// route, preferences, even the destination. Weather appears only once a place is known.

